the parole system, as you know it...

167
00:17:17,290 --> 00:17:19,366
...was rendered obsolete.

168
00:17:21,294 --> 00:17:23,417
Federal Statute 537-29....

169
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:28,831
Stop it!

170
00:17:32,430 --> 00:17:35,300
Do you have anything fresh to say
on your behalf?

171
00:17:38,978 --> 00:17:40,306
I thought not.

172
00:17:43,065 --> 00:17:43,979
Yeah.

173
00:17:44,191 --> 00:17:45,354
I do.

174
00:17:46,318 --> 00:17:47,481
Teddy bear.

175
00:18:05,254 --> 00:18:07,163
How'd you know the password?

176
00:18:07,423 --> 00:18:08,917
I wish I knew.

177
00:18:09,008 --> 00:18:10,668
Simon says:. die.

178
00:18:29,194 --> 00:18:30,357
Warden...

179
00:18:31,029 --> 00:18:33,069
...Iet's get this over quickly.

180
00:18:40,247 --> 00:18:43,497
Retina coding accepted,
Warden William Smithers.

181
00:18:44,751 --> 00:18:45,747
Be well.

182
