Now all restaurants are Pizza Hut.

788
00:57:13,868 --> 00:57:15,113
No way.

789
00:57:24,754 --> 00:57:26,628
Welcome to Pizza Hut.

790
00:57:27,257 --> 00:57:28,881
Enjoy your meal.

791
00:57:30,593 --> 00:57:33,001
"Valley of the Jolly Green Giant

792
00:57:35,682 --> 00:57:37,924
"Good things from the garden

793
00:57:38,184 --> 00:57:40,058
"Garden in the valley

794
00:57:40,687 --> 00:57:43,178
"Valley of the Jolly Green Giant"

795
00:57:46,401 --> 00:57:48,559
Here comes the Neanderthal.

796
00:57:49,153 --> 00:57:52,024
Mr. Spartan over there please,
and Lieutenant....

797
00:57:52,156 --> 00:57:53,271
Thank you.

798
00:57:56,411 --> 00:57:58,071
How are you doing?

799
00:58:00,540 --> 00:58:02,616
Enjoy-joy your meal, sir.

800
00:58:03,459 --> 00:58:04,622
Good thing I'm hungry.

801
00:58:04,710 --> 00:58:09,171
Ladies and gentlemen, please raise
your glasses to the hero of the hour...

802
00:58:09,757 --> 00:58:11,335
...my savior...

803
00:58:11,467 --> 00:58:13,590
...Detective John Spartan.

804
00:58:15,888 --> 00:58:17,263
Appreciate it.

805
00:58:20,434 --> 00:58:22,178
Greetings and salutations.

806
00:58:22,436 --> 00:58:24,014
I'm Associate Bob.

807
00:58:24,105 --> 00:58:27,770
We met before, ever so briefly.
I was in fear at the time.

808
00:58:28,943 --> 00:58:30,816
Do you have the salt?

809
00:58:31,862 --> 00:58:34,863
Salt is not good for you, hence, it is illegal.

810
00:58:35,116 --> 00:58:37,025
So, John Spartan, tell me...

811
00:58:37,868 --> 00:58:40,786
...what do you think of San Angeles, 2032?

812
00:58:42,540 --> 00:58:45,790
I thought the future would be
a rotting cesspool.

813
00:58:46,794 --> 00:58:49,960
You weren't here
when the real disturbances began.

814
00:58:50,047 --> 00:58:52,716
Civilization tried to destroy itself.

815
00:58:53,133 --> 00:58:56,134
The city degenerated into a total fear zone.

816
00:58:56,637 --> 00:59:01,050
People stayed home, afraid to go out.
People wanted the madness over.

817
00:59:02,267 --> 00:59:05,102
When I saw the chance
to make things right...

818
00:59:05,270 --> 00:59:06,729
...I seized it.

819
00:59:08,315 --> 00:59:12,229
If I had not, the radiance
of San Angeles would not be here.

820
00:59:12,653 --> 00:59:17,361
Just your rotting cesspool of hate
and suffering. Which would you prefer?

821
00:59:17,658 --> 00:59:21,323
Can you book me a flight out of here
when the sermon's over?

822
00:59:21,495 --> 00:59:22,823
John Spartan...

823
00:59:22,996 --> 00:59:26,246
...for your crimes you would
surely have died...

824
00:59:26,333 --> 00:59:27,744
...in jail before now.

825
00:59:27,834 --> 00:59:31,832
Even you must appreciate
the persuasively tranquil humanity...

826
00:59:32,339 --> 00:59:34,628
...of the cryo-prison system?

827
00:59:35,509 --> 00:59:40,301
I don't want to spoil your dinner, but
my cryo-sentence was no sweet lullaby.

828
00:59:40,472 --> 00:59:42,511
I had feelings and thoughts.

829
00:59:42,724 --> 00:59:46,473
How about a 36-year nightmare
about people caught in a burning building?

830
00:59:46,561 --> 00:59:48,601
You were awake? I don't think so.

831
00:59:48,688 --> 00:59:50,099
I think so.

832
00:59:50,607 --> 00:59:54,521
My wife beating her fists against a block
of ice that was her husband.

833
00:59:54,611 --> 00:59:59,189
Then you woke me up and told me
everything that meant something is gone.

834
00:59:59,699 --> 01:00:03,827
It would have been more humane
to leave me to the fucking crows.

835
01:00:04,996 --> 01:00:08,116
What would you say
if I called you a brutish fossil...

836
01:00:08,208 --> 01:00:11,659
...symbolic of the decayed era
gratefully forgotten?

837
01:00:13,171 --> 01:00:14,831
I don't know. "Thanks?"

838
01:00:15,548 --> 01:00:17,707
I thought during rehabilitation...

839
01:00:17,884 --> 01:00:21,882
...the prisoners were not conscious.
A person would go insane.

840
01:00:22,013 --> 01:00:24,006
The side-effects of the cryo-process...

841
01:00:24,098 --> 01:00:25,474
...are unavoidable.

842
01:00:25,558 --> 01:00:27,551
You were found guilty of a crime.

843
01:00:27,643 --> 01:00:29,719
You owed and still owe a debt to society.

844
01:00:29,812 --> 01:00:31,057
There's nothing I can do.

845
01:00:31,147 --> 01:00:33,934
Yes, call for backup.
I'll be across the street.

846
01:00:34,025 --> 01:00:35,484
Where are you going?

847
01:00:35,568 --> 01:00:39,482
Bad guys about to do bad things.
It's just one of those hunches.

848
01:01:00,051 --> 01:01:01,213
Go for the truck!

849
01:01:01,302 --> 01:01:03,010
The food's in the truck!

850
01:01:05,806 --> 01:01:07,846
Grab the big box! Move!

851
01:01:19,695 --> 01:01:23,194
You'll regret this the rest of your life.
Both seconds of it.

852
01:01:28,454 --> 01:01:29,616
Good night!

853
01:01:39,423 --> 01:01:40,703
Get him!

854
01:01:58,483 --> 01:02:00,809
What a fucking hero. Come on.

855
01:02:10,370 --> 01:02:11,745
Please, don't.

856
01:02:17,711 --> 01:02:18,991
What the hell?

857
01:02:20,005 --> 01:02:21,665
Such reckless abandonment.

858
01:02:21,756 --> 01:02:24,164
Looks like there is a new shepherd in town.

859
01:02:24,259 --> 01:02:26,548
That's "sheriff." Who are those guys?

860
01:02:26,636 --> 01:02:28,676
They're known as "scraps."

861
01:02:29,014 --> 01:02:31,683
Outcasts and deserters who choose
to live beneath us...

862
01:02:31,766 --> 01:02:34,340
...in sewers and abandoned tunnels.

863
01:02:35,353 --> 01:02:38,437
They're a constant irritation
to our harmony.

864
01:02:38,857 --> 01:02:40,648
They're nothing but thugs.

865
01:02:41,025 --> 01:02:45,189
A society of thieves. The last remaining
criminal element in the city.

866
01:02:45,446 --> 01:02:48,815
But plans are in progress
to purge this peril from our day.

867
01:02:49,158 --> 01:02:51,614
You're better live than on laser disk.

868
01:02:51,703 --> 01:02:55,285
The way you paused to make a witticism
before doing battle...

869
01:02:55,456 --> 01:02:57,200
...with that Scrap--

870
01:02:57,375 --> 01:02:59,368
This isn't the Wild West, okay?

871
01:02:59,460 --> 01:03:01,916
The Wild West wasn't even the Wild West.

872
01:03:02,004 --> 01:03:03,831
Hurting people isn't good.

873
01:03:04,132 --> 01:03:05,792
Sometimes it is, but not...

874
01:03:05,883 --> 01:03:08,209
...when it's people looking for food.

875
01:03:16,686 --> 01:03:19,011
San Angeles time is now 22:15.

876
01:03:20,314 --> 01:03:21,559
Coding off.

877
01:03:21,732 --> 01:03:22,847
Auto-drive.

878
01:03:22,942 --> 01:03:24,733
Auto-drive engaged.

879
01:03:30,241 --> 01:03:32,364
I'm sorry I yelled at you.

880
01:03:34,161 --> 01:03:36,487
No need for a de-hurtful retraction.

881
01:03:36,789 --> 01:03:39,327
I assimilated too much contraband.

882
01:03:39,625 --> 01:03:43,753
I fleshed you out as
a blow-up-the-bad- guy-while-grinning type.

883
01:03:44,004 --> 01:03:48,465
But you're the moody-gunslinger-who-
will-only-draw-when-he-must type.

884
01:03:49,593 --> 01:03:50,423
Stop.

885
01:03:50,511 --> 01:03:51,341
What?

886
01:03:51,428 --> 01:03:53,670
I just do my job and things get--

887
01:03:53,764 --> 01:03:54,927
Demolished.

888
01:04:02,523 --> 01:04:06,141
I think of my daughter growing up
in a place like this.

889
01:04:06,402 --> 01:04:09,189
I'm afraid she'll think I'm a primitive.

890
01:04:09,363 --> 01:04:12,399
As much as I want to see her,
I almost don't want to.

891
01:04:12,491 --> 01:04:15,112
Because I don't think I'll fit in well.

892
01:04:15,285 --> 01:04:16,696
Not at all.

893
01:04:19,081 --> 01:04:23,161
It'd be a minor misuse of police powers,
but I could do a search for you.

894
01:04:28,966 --> 01:04:30,164
Sorry.

895
01:04:34,262 --> 01:04:36,670
Subject change. I got what you wanted.

896
01:04:36,807 --> 01:04:37,969
Great.

897
01:04:42,229 --> 01:04:43,604
What's that for?

898
01:04:44,689 --> 01:04:46,896
It's just one of those cop hunches.

899
01:04:56,368 --> 01:04:57,613
Lights.

900
01:04:59,162 --> 01:05:00,905
I've changed that.

901
01:05:01,748 --> 01:05:03,159
Illuminate.

902
