Raymond, Raymond, we've got to talk.

907
01:05:21,517 --> 01:05:23,142
How did you get in?

908
01:05:23,269 --> 01:05:25,641
Wish I knew. I got pass codes.

909
01:05:26,522 --> 01:05:28,100
Routes to underground kingdoms.

910
01:05:28,191 --> 01:05:31,773
Complete access
to the industrial data-grid interface.

911
01:05:32,195 --> 01:05:34,353
I don't even know what that means.

912
01:05:34,530 --> 01:05:37,531
But I've been meaning to ask you,
because I like it!

913
01:05:37,617 --> 01:05:39,111
I like it a lot!

914
01:05:41,037 --> 01:05:43,444
You have been given these skills
for a reason.

915
01:05:43,539 --> 01:05:45,947
Not for your personal amusement.

916
01:05:46,250 --> 01:05:50,200
Your job is to kill Mr. Edgar Friendly
and stop a revolution.

917
01:05:51,172 --> 01:05:53,745
That is why you were rehabilitated.

918
01:05:56,802 --> 01:06:00,385
All right. I'm going to do
your dastardly deed for you.

919
