You're more trouble than you're worth.

930
01:06:38,927 --> 01:06:41,169
Oh, Raymond, don't say that.

931
01:06:43,015 --> 01:06:45,553
And what do I get out of all this?

932
01:06:48,020 --> 01:06:49,597
What do you want?

933
01:06:50,189 --> 01:06:51,184
Malibu.

934
01:06:52,107 --> 01:06:55,606
Santa Monica.
Hell, how about all the coastal cities?

935
01:06:57,195 --> 01:06:59,022
I'll bear it in mind.

936
01:06:59,197 --> 01:07:02,198
-Good, I'll send you a memo.
-Just do your job!

937
01:07:06,872 --> 01:07:09,279
What is John Spartan doing here?

938
01:07:11,042 --> 01:07:13,201
Did you invite him to this party?

939
01:07:15,130 --> 01:07:17,206
Look, you finish your business...

940
01:07:17,299 --> 01:07:19,457
...and I'll stuff him back in the freezer.

941
01:07:19,551 --> 01:07:21,793
Think of him as a guarantee.

942
01:07:22,053 --> 01:07:23,512
"A guarantee?"

943
01:07:24,306 --> 01:07:26,631
You don't have much of a guarantee.

944
01:07:27,225 --> 01:07:30,511
I took care of Spartan once,
I'll take care of him again.

945
01:07:33,815 --> 01:07:36,223
Now we need those men defrosted.

946
01:07:40,905 --> 01:07:42,565
Is this where you live?

947
01:07:42,741 --> 01:07:44,151
Very not bad.

948
01:07:44,325 --> 01:07:45,440
Thank you.

949
01:07:46,077 --> 01:07:48,070
Where will I be staying?

950
01:07:48,246 --> 01:07:51,615
I've procured you a domicile
down the corridor from my own.

951
01:07:55,044 --> 01:07:57,998
Everything is voice coded,
so if you need something, just ask.

952
01:07:58,089 --> 01:07:59,252
Lights.

953
01:08:00,842 --> 01:08:02,300
What do you think?

954
01:08:03,303 --> 01:08:07,003
Clicked off a lot of credits to create
the perfect 20th-century apartment.

955
01:08:07,098 --> 01:08:08,426
It's very....

956
01:08:08,599 --> 01:08:09,679
Isn't it?

957
01:08:12,520 --> 01:08:13,931
John Spartan....

958
01:08:16,357 --> 01:08:18,848
There's a well-known, documented...

959
01:08:19,026 --> 01:08:21,600
...connection between sex and violence.

960
01:08:22,363 --> 01:08:24,439
Not so much a causal effect...

961
01:08:24,615 --> 01:08:27,700
...but a general state
of neurological arousal.

962
01:08:28,202 --> 01:08:29,400
And...

963
01:08:29,704 --> 01:08:33,488
...after having observed
your behavior this evening and...

964
01:08:34,375 --> 01:08:36,617
...my resultant condition...

965
01:08:39,714 --> 01:08:42,714
...I was wondering
if you'd like to have sex?

966
01:08:48,055 --> 01:08:49,134
With you?

967
01:08:51,809 --> 01:08:52,722
Here?

968
01:08:53,811 --> 01:08:54,890
Now?

969
01:08:57,648 --> 01:08:58,561
Yeah.

970
01:08:59,400 --> 01:09:00,349
Great!

971
01:09:03,070 --> 01:09:04,564
I'll be right back.

972
01:09:22,089 --> 01:09:23,464
Love Boat?

973
01:09:43,068 --> 01:09:44,313
There you go.

974
01:09:49,908 --> 01:09:53,028
Now, just relax.
We'll begin in a few seconds.

975
01:09:54,246 --> 01:09:55,574
Begin what?

976
01:09:56,248 --> 01:09:58,157
Having sex, of course.

977
01:10:56,974 --> 01:10:58,433
You broke contact.

978
01:10:58,601 --> 01:11:01,056
"Contact?" I didn't even touch you yet.

979
01:11:01,145 --> 01:11:03,303
You said you wanted to make love.

980
01:11:03,648 --> 01:11:05,225
Is that what this is?

981
01:11:07,610 --> 01:11:12,236
Vir-sex produces high alpha waves
during transference of sexual energies.

982
01:11:12,448 --> 01:11:14,986
Let's do it the old-fashioned way.

983
01:11:15,993 --> 01:11:17,321
Disgusting!

984
01:11:17,495 --> 01:11:18,657
You mean...

985
01:11:20,122 --> 01:11:23,740
-...fluid transfer?
-No, I mean boning, the wild mambo.

986
01:11:25,127 --> 01:11:26,835
That is no longer done.

987
01:11:27,171 --> 01:11:30,374
Do you know what the exchange
of bodily fluids leads to?

988
01:11:30,507 --> 01:11:32,880
Kids, smoking, desire to raid the fridge.

989
01:11:32,968 --> 01:11:37,677
Rampant exchange of bodily fluids
was a major cause of society's downfall.

990
01:11:38,140 --> 01:11:41,260
After AlDS, there was NRS,
then there was UBT.

991
01:11:41,852 --> 01:11:44,972
One of the first things Cocteau did
was to outlaw...

992
01:11:45,147 --> 01:11:49,145
...and engineer all fluid transfer
out of socially acceptable behavior.

993
01:11:49,359 --> 01:11:52,029
Not even a mouth transfer's condoned.

994
01:11:52,196 --> 01:11:53,606
Kissing's not allowed?

995
01:11:53,697 --> 01:11:55,191
I was a good kisser.

996
01:11:56,992 --> 01:11:58,320
What about kids?

997
01:11:58,869 --> 01:12:00,328
Procreation?

998
01:12:00,662 --> 01:12:02,156
We go to a lab.

999
01:12:02,372 --> 01:12:04,448
Fluids are purified, screened...

1000
01:12:04,541 --> 01:12:07,827
...and transferred by authorized
medical personnel only.

1001
01:12:08,003 --> 01:12:09,877
It is the only legal way.

1002
01:12:13,341 --> 01:12:14,800
What're you doing?

1003
01:12:15,510 --> 01:12:16,921
Breaking the law.

1004
01:12:18,722 --> 01:12:20,845
You are a savage creature.

1005
01:12:21,349 --> 01:12:23,887
I wish you to leave my domicile. Now!

1006
01:12:30,400 --> 01:12:31,728
You know....

1007
01:12:52,213 --> 01:12:54,835
Code accepted. Be well, John Spartan.

1008
01:13:05,059 --> 01:13:06,304
Lights.

1009
01:13:24,078 --> 01:13:26,949
"He doesn't know how
to use the three seashells."

1010
01:13:33,796 --> 01:13:35,456
Happy Halloween.

1011
01:14:06,954 --> 01:14:09,030
"Behavioral engineering?"

1012
01:14:10,165 --> 01:14:13,949
Hi, Martin, I was thinking....
Oh, my God, I'm sorry, wrong number.

1013
01:14:26,849 --> 01:14:29,885
Our noble facility has been desecrated
by hooligans.

1014
01:14:30,811 --> 01:14:33,183
Someone will pay dearly for this.

1015
01:14:36,858 --> 01:14:40,310
Sir, the stress breeder
is inside being demobilized.

1016
01:14:41,822 --> 01:14:44,941
Shit! Being frozen must've thrown
my aim off. Don't worry.

1017
01:14:45,033 --> 01:14:46,527
The next shot.

1018
01:14:46,702 --> 01:14:48,326
I don't think so.

1019
01:14:48,995 --> 01:14:51,154
No kiss-kiss, no bang-bang.

1020
01:15:04,219 --> 01:15:06,377
I'm sorry about last night.

1021
01:15:08,348 --> 01:15:09,842
I made this for you.

1022
01:15:13,728 --> 01:15:14,677
For me?

1023
01:15:17,399 --> 01:15:18,727
Thank you.

1024
01:15:22,070 --> 01:15:23,232
I'll drive.

1025
01:15:23,696 --> 01:15:26,069
I must learn to do this sometime.

1026
01:15:39,921 --> 01:15:41,748
Thanks for the lovely gift.

1027
01:15:42,715 --> 01:15:47,424
I don't know what was in my cryo-sludge
but when I thawed, I wanted to knit.

1028
01:15:47,929 --> 01:15:51,878
How come I know what a zipperfoot,
a shuttle and a bobbin is?

1029
01:15:52,934 --> 01:15:55,851
I could weave a throw rug now
with my eyes closed.

1030
01:15:56,229 --> 01:15:58,305
It's part of your rehab program.

1031
01:15:58,397 --> 01:16:01,185
For each inmate the computer
draws up a skill or trade...

1032
01:16:01,275 --> 01:16:03,184
...suited to their genetic disposition.

1033
01:16:03,277 --> 01:16:04,985
It implants the knowledge...

1034
01:16:05,071 --> 01:16:08,155
...and the desire to carry out
the training assigned.

1035
01:16:09,784 --> 01:16:11,278
I'm a seamstress?

1036
01:16:11,744 --> 01:16:13,072
That's great.

1037
01:16:13,245 --> 01:16:15,867
I come out of cryo-prison
and I'm Betsy-fucking-Ross.

1038
01:16:15,956 --> 01:16:18,412
Phoenix can access computers,
operate all vehicles...

1039
01:16:18,501 --> 01:16:20,873
...knows the location
of everything in town...

1040
01:16:20,961 --> 01:16:23,583
...and is three times stronger than before?

1041
01:16:26,133 --> 01:16:28,624
Can you get me his rehab program?

1042
01:16:31,263 --> 01:16:34,181
-I'm a seamstress.
-Access code for Simon Phoenix.

