to do with that archaic device?

1094
01:19:09,753 --> 01:19:11,413
No, I didn't think so.

1095
01:19:13,465 --> 01:19:16,585
The only thing I haven't got
under control is you.

1096
01:19:16,760 --> 01:19:18,753
But that can be solved.

1097
01:19:18,929 --> 01:19:22,464
You, my Cro-Magnon friend, are dead.
Your family's dead...

1098
01:19:22,641 --> 01:19:24,219
