1114
01:20:09,312 --> 01:20:13,310
I must get that maniac and put him
on ice or that's where I'll be.

1115
01:20:13,525 --> 01:20:16,312
-Enhance your calm.
-I've had it with enhancing my calm.

1116
01:20:16,403 --> 01:20:20,981
I'll enhance that psycho's calm.
Then I'll turn my attention to Cocteau.

1117
01:20:22,534 --> 01:20:25,321
You don't have to come with me.
I can do it alone.

1118
01:20:25,412 --> 01:20:29,243
