1189
01:25:46,312 --> 01:25:49,598
Greed, deception, abuse of power.
That's no plan.

1190
01:25:52,151 --> 01:25:54,524
-That's why you're here?
-That's right.

1191
01:25:54,696 --> 01:25:55,691
See....

1192
01:25:56,155 --> 01:25:58,148
According to Cocteau's plan...

1193
01:25:58,324 --> 01:26:00,815
...I'm an enemy because I like to think.

1194
01:26:01,160 --> 01:26:02,275
I like to read.

1195
01:26:02,370 --> 01:26:04,244
I'm into freedom of speech and choice.

1196
01:26:04,330 --> 01:26:05,955
I like to sit in a greasy spoon...

1197
01:26:06,040 --> 01:26:10,334
...and think, "Should I have steak
or barbecued ribs with gravy fries?"

1198
01:26:10,545 --> 01:26:11,920
I want high cholesterol.

1199
01:26:12,004 --> 01:26:14,495
I want to eat bacon, butter and cheese.

1200
01:26:14,674 --> 01:26:17,425
I want to smoke a Cuban cigar
the size of Cincinnati.

1201
01:26:17,510 --> 01:26:20,427
I want to run through the streets naked...

1202
01:26:20,680 --> 01:26:23,883
...reading Playboy magazine
because I might need to.

1203
01:26:24,058 --> 01:26:25,600
I've seen the future.

1204
01:26:25,685 --> 01:26:27,511
It's a 47-year-old virgin...

1205
01:26:27,603 --> 01:26:30,639
...drinking a banana-broccoli shake
and singing "I'm a wiener."

1206
01:26:30,731 --> 01:26:32,273
Up top, you live Cocteau's way.

1207
01:26:32,358 --> 01:26:34,516
What he wants, when he wants,
how he wants.

1208
01:26:34,610 --> 01:26:36,852
Your other choice: come here.

1209
01:26:38,155 --> 01:26:39,733
Maybe starve to death.

1210
01:26:40,533 --> 01:26:43,818
Why don't you take charge
and lead these people out of here?

1211
01:26:43,911 --> 01:26:45,109
I'm no leader.

1212
01:26:45,329 --> 01:26:47,156
I do what I have to do.

1213
01:26:47,289 --> 01:26:48,867
Sometimes people join me.

1214
01:26:48,958 --> 01:26:53,584
I just want to bury Cocteau up to his neck
in shit and let him think happy thoughts.

1215
01:26:53,963 --> 01:26:55,789
Then I got bad news.

1216
01:26:56,548 --> 01:26:58,755
I think he wants to kill you.

1217
01:27:01,553 --> 01:27:04,009
All right gentlemen, let's review.

1218
01:27:04,807 --> 01:27:06,182
The year is 2032.

1219
01:27:07,017 --> 01:27:09,769
That's 2-0-3-2. As in the 21st century.

1220
01:27:11,104 --> 01:27:15,268
And I'm sorry to say that
the world has become a pussy-whipped...

1221
01:27:16,193 --> 01:27:20,356
...Brady Bunch version of itself
run by a bunch of robed sissies.

1222
01:27:21,406 --> 01:27:24,193
All we have to do to run the whole thing...

1223
