...is to kill a man named Friendly,
who put it all together.

1224
01:27:29,498 --> 01:27:31,989
But there's an extra added bonus.

1225
01:27:33,752 --> 01:27:35,246
We get to kill...

1226
01:27:35,420 --> 01:27:37,745
...the man who put us in the freezer.

1227
01:27:37,923 --> 01:27:39,085
You mean...

1228
01:27:39,257 --> 01:27:41,001
...we get to kill John Spartan?

1229
