It is a curious conclusion
which you have deduced, John Spartan.

1237
01:28:07,619 --> 01:28:10,370
But I can find no fault in your logic.

1238
01:28:10,497 --> 01:28:14,625
Phoenix is the perfect weapon to send
into these savage regions.

1239
01:28:15,335 --> 01:28:17,292
I'm impressed, John Spartan.

1240
01:28:17,503 --> 01:28:20,125
They thawed him out just to kill me?

1241
01:28:21,215 --> 01:28:24,335
-I'm flattered.
-Don't be flattered. Be frightened.

1242
01:28:24,594 --> 01:28:26,800
This guy's a certifiable nightmare.

1243
01:28:26,971 --> 01:28:28,964
That's why you're here?

1244
01:28:31,351 --> 01:28:34,933
I must have done something right
in the previous life.

1245
01:28:35,438 --> 01:28:37,929
Can't imagine what that could have been.

1246
01:28:39,901 --> 01:28:41,609
Two for the price of one.

1247
01:28:41,861 --> 01:28:43,521
Let's take them.

1248
01:28:48,492 --> 01:28:49,821
Stay down!

1249
01:29:22,943 --> 01:29:25,861
I'll be damned.
Like a New York cockroach.

1250
01:29:55,600 --> 01:29:57,308
Everything's gone wrong.

1251
01:30:13,827 --> 01:30:16,282
There's an elevator shaft at the top.

1252
01:30:18,582 --> 01:30:20,124
So we're going up?

1253
01:30:20,292 --> 01:30:22,865
Momentito, Senorita Huxley. Come on.

1254
01:30:41,521 --> 01:30:44,226
